WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
How to create your Swift Agents widget — from your dashboard to live

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1 of 4 — Your widget code stays locked until you're on a plan

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Press Upgrade and subscribe. The code unlocks straight after

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 2 of 4 — Your widget is already here. The snippet is the widget

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Choose Widget or Button. Button mode opens the chat from your own button

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Press Reveal to unmask your company ID

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Copy the snippet

8
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Step 3 of 4 — In Settings, API Keys, press Generate

9
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Copy the key now — it is shown only once

10
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Step 4 of 4 — Paste the snippet into your page, just before the closing body tag

11
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Swap YOUR_API_KEY for the key you generated

12
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:26.000
That's it — your agent is live on your site
